      148.65,
      319.21,
      438.79,
      330.28
    ],
    "text": "FILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF VICE CHAIRMAN",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      212.73,
      332.41,
      374.71,
      343.48
    ],
    "text": "OF THE ERAVUR URBAN COUNCIL",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      91.29,
      345.37,
      496.18,
      382.36
    ],
    "text": "UNDER SECTION 65A (1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)AS AMENDED BY LOCAL AUTHORITIES (SPECIAL PROVISIONS) ACT, No. 30 OF 2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      397.21,
      539.61,
      421.48
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the office of vice Chairman in Eravur Urban Council has fallen vacant by reason of Vice Chairman has beenappointed as Chairman ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      436.33,
      539.91,
      486.28
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Secretary of the United People's Freedom Alliance, the recognized political party to whichMohamed Ismail Mohamed Thasleem the former Vice Chairman belonged, was required by me under Section 65A(1) of theaforesaid Ordinance, to decide upon the member of that Eravur Urban Council who belongs to such party who shall bedeclared elected as Vice Chairman within a period of thirty (30) days ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      501.37,
      539.84,
      525.4
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision tonominate Mr. Meera Labbay Rebu Pasam, to fill such vacancy ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      540.25,
      539.91,
      590.44
    ],
    "text": "NOW THEREFORE I, Abdul Majeed Mahammadu Kabeer, Returning Officer of Eravur Urban Council, acting interms of Section 65A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance as amended by filling of vacancies in Local Authorities(Special Provisions) Act, No. 30 of 2013 (Chapter 262) do hereby declare Mr. Meera Labbay Rebu Pasam elected as ViceChairman of the Eravur Urban Council.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      605.29,
      535.53,
      681.4
    ],
    "text": "A.M. M. KABEER,Returning Officer,Eravur Urban Council.District Elections Office,Batticaloa,01st April, 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
